      "name": "_format_plain_text_table",
      "line_number": 8987,
      "docstring": "Renders structured data as visually-aligned plain-text table for code blocks.\n\nKey features:\n- Auto-calculates or uses provided column widths\n- Supports multi-line headers\n- Handles text alignment (L/R/C) using Python format strings\n- Optional text wrapping with textwrap for long content\n- Uses spaces (not pipes) for column separation\n- Adds separator line (---) below headers\n\nReturns list of strings (lines) ready for ``` markdown ``` blocks.",
